      "name": "Label · Sign in",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -4600,
      "width": 9140,
      "theme": {
        "ui:mode": "light"
      },
      "descendants": {
        "ui:E87RGF": {
          "content": "Sign in · Cloud"
        },
        "ui:G8OhZ": {
          "content": "Draft"
        },
        "ui:SH1DB": {
          "content": "/auth/login · /auth/verify · /onboarding/workspace"
        },
        "ui:z4SKuT": {
          "content": "Cloud variant: the dashboard picks it at runtime when GetCapabilities returns auth.methods = [github, email_code] and auth.signup = open. Only GitHub and passwordless email; the same flow signs up new users, so there's no separate sign-up page. Email uses the existing 6-digit verification codes (identity SendVerificationCode, 5 min). GAPS: GetCapabilities doesn't exist yet (edition is the build-time DASHBOARD_EDITION today); needs a new exchange that trades a verified code for tokens. GitHub shows only when OAuth is configured."
        }
      }
    },
