          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RMYsD",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "#451A03",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Regions live on Home: one row each with a status dot (green connected, amber waiting, red offline or unsupported version, plus one line saying which). Public region id is always `default`.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m3uBs",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "#451A03",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• A waiting region shows its install command inline (Compose | Helm, Copy, expiry). Once it connects, the command hides. New region = ID, display name, SIP domain, then it appears as waiting.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "R82fL9",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "#451A03",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• ⋯ opens a right panel: status, version, last seen, connection details (copy), workspaces, provider keys Set/Missing, Re-issue token and Disconnect (confirmed inline). No other region detail pages.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xMqXQ",
          "name": "Bullet",
          "fill": "#451A03",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Inside a workspace: Create workspace Region select, a single Settings › Region line, Secrets Set/Missing, and Calls/Overview offline lines.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "Poppins",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
